---
import AwenDashboard from './AwenDashboard.jsx';
---
<section class="section" id="awen">
  <div class="awen">
    <div class="awen-inner">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="num">03</span>Proprietary tooling</div>
        <div>
          <img src="/assets/awen-logo-dark.svg" alt="Awen — Data Assurance Platform" style="height: 56px; display: block; margin-bottom: 28px;" />
          <h2 class="section-title">
            Enterprise-scale outcomes <em>at boutique speed.</em>
          </h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="section-sub" style="margin-top: -40px; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: auto; max-width: 64ch;">
        Awen is our internal data assurance platform, purpose-built for ISO 19650
        engagements. It&rsquo;s the tooling behind every engagement we deliver &mdash; from
        Health Check diagnostics through to retained monitoring.
      </p>
      <div class="awen-gate-wrap">
        <div class="awen-gate-frame"><AwenDashboard /></div>
        <div class="awen-gate-overlay">
          <span class="awen-gate-eyebrow">Sample workspace preview</span>
          <p class="awen-gate-copy">Request a live walkthrough and we&rsquo;ll show you Awen working against a sample project profile, tailored to your sector.</p>
          <a href="#contact" class="awen-gate-cta">Request a demo &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(241,237,227,0.08); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; color: rgba(241,237,227,0.7);" class="awen-features">
        <div>
          <div style="font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(241,237,227,0.4); margin-bottom: 10px;">i. Document generation</div>
          <div style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 18px; color: var(--bg); font-weight: 380; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 8px;">Author the standard, don&rsquo;t just audit it</div>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55;">BEPs, EIRs, employer&rsquo;s information requirements, gap analyses and remediation notes &mdash; produced at pace, evidence-backed, and checked by us before they reach you. The platform drafts; we govern quality.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(241,237,227,0.4); margin-bottom: 10px;">ii. Compliance enforcement</div>
          <div style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 18px; color: var(--bg); font-weight: 380; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 8px;">At the CDE boundary, not after</div>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55;">Non-compliant data doesn&rsquo;t make it into the workspace in the first place &mdash; problems are caught at the point of entry, not discovered downstream.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(241,237,227,0.4); margin-bottom: 10px;">iii. Engagement dashboards</div>
          <div style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 18px; color: var(--bg); font-weight: 380; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 8px;">Visibility for the client, not just us</div>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55;">Live compliance rates, workflow adoption, and remediation progress &mdash; accessible to every stakeholder, narrated by us each month.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
